Description: Sesuaikan test "tries both shifted key and base with shift modifier"
 dengan perilaku 1.2.3. Commit 9da0f9d (masuk 1.2.3) hanya mencoba keyCode jika
 Alt/Meta/Ctrl ditekan, tetapi test-nya baru disesuaikan setelah tag 1.2.3
 dirilis. Hanya file test yang diubah; source tidak berubah.
Origin: upstream, https://code.haverbeke.berlin/prosemirror/prosemirror-keymap/commit/c2eebe83ea2be747ade21bd9c3992a0ed98b5f64
Author: Marijn Haverbeke <marijn@haverbeke.berlin>
Applied-Upstream: c2eebe83ea2be747ade21bd9c3992a0ed98b5f64 (setelah 1.2.3; hapus patch ini saat impor versi berikutnya)
Last-Update: 2026-10-28
---
diff --git a/vendor/prosemirror/prosemirror-keymap/test/test-keymap.ts b/vendor/prosemirror/prosemirror-keymap/test/test-keymap.ts
--- a/vendor/prosemirror/prosemirror-keymap/test/test-keymap.ts
+++ b/vendor/prosemirror/prosemirror-keymap/test/test-keymap.ts
@@ -47,9 +47,9 @@ describe("keymap", () => {
 
   it("tries both shifted key and base with shift modifier", () => {
     let percent = counter(), shift5 = counter()
-    dispatch(keymap({"%": percent}), "%", {shiftKey: true, keyCode: 53})
+    dispatch(keymap({"Ctrl-%": percent}), "%", {shiftKey: true, ctrlKey: true, keyCode: 53})
     ist(percent.count, 1)
-    dispatch(keymap({"Shift-5": shift5}), "%", {shiftKey: true, keyCode: 53})
+    dispatch(keymap({"Ctrl-Shift-5": shift5}), "%", {shiftKey: true, ctrlKey: true, keyCode: 53})
     ist(shift5.count, 1)
   })
 
